.TH "JSONKIT\-MANPAGE\-GENERATE" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-manpage\-generate \- Write the man pages to a folder.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit manpage generate\fR \-\-out <folder> [options]
.fi
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR <\fIfolder\fR>
The folder to write the man pages in. It is created when missing.  (required)
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-manpage\fR(1)
